    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Backup age",
      "description": "Time since a dump was verified and uploaded — read back with gunzip -t and measured against a floor, not merely attempted. Rises steadily and drops to zero at 02:17; a sawtooth that stops climbing down is the failure.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
